  classifications, hand-written notes, structural compilations, design
  documents) is licensed separately under CC BY-NC 4.0 — see LICENSE-DATA.md.
- Images sourced from the One Piece Fandom wiki remain the property of their
  respective rights holders. Fandom community contributions are licensed
  CC BY-SA 3.0 where applicable.

This is a non-commercial fan project. If you are a representative of
Shueisha / Toei and wish content removed, please open an issue at
https://github.com/ShimotsukiKajiya/one-piece-chapter-map/issues
or contact via that GitHub account.
